@item a birthday, anniversary, or billing date
@tab @code{date}
@tab there is no time of day and no timezone
@item opening hours, an alarm, or a daily cutoff
@tab @code{wall-time}
@tab the value repeats every day and has no date
@item an appointment or a log timestamp without a zone
@tab @code{datetime}
@tab both the calendar date and the clock time matter
@item a timeout, a benchmark, or elapsed time
@tab @code{duration}
@tab a displacement is not a position
@item an exact instant across timezones
@tab not yet
@tab @code{timestamp} is planned (@pxref{Limits and roadmap})
@item a half-open range of dates or times
@tab not yet
@tab @code{interval} is planned (@pxref{Limits and roadmap})
@item a value parsed from text
@tab not yet
@tab parsing is planned; validate fields for now
@end multitable

